      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/QuitoNitura/status/2026331304175005847",
      "text": "On this day, 40 years ago, the Filipino people showed to the world the power of true unity. Today we commemorate the bloodless toppling of the 20-year dictatorship of Ferdinand Marcos.\n\nEven if the son and namesake is now the President, I refuse to believe that the spirit of EDSA is lost. Its fire may have been reduced to a small flame or embers, especially after the impunity of the Duterte administration which tore the fabric of the nation. But it remains; silent but enduring within our hearts. It is the task of our generation of Filipinos to tend to the flame so that it will be strong again to chase away the darkness that has engulfed our nation. History has its eyes on us. \n\nPaalabin ang apoy at diwa ng EDSA sa ating mga puso. Lagi't lagi, para sa Bayan.\n\n#NeverForget #NeverAgain\n#MarcosMagnanakawHindiBayani\n#EDSA40\n\nhttps://t.co/88kdLKDl5U",
